 kdash inspector - keys (any key returns)

 FIND                          PANES                       NAVIGATE
  /  find in this pane         s  summary                  j k arrows  line
  &  show only matches         d  describe                 space b     page
  n N  next / previous match   e  events                   PgUp PgDn   page
  L  log level: all, ERROR,    !  why (event hypotheses)    g G Home End  top/bottom
     WARN, INFO, DEBUG         l  current logs             c  choose container
  f  follow logs               p  previous logs            r  reload now
  w  export what you see       q Esc  back                ?  this help

 / keeps the context around every match and highlights it; & hides everything else.
 A lowercase pattern ignores case: /error finds ERROR and error.
 n and N wrap around and put the match at the top of the pane.
 c lists every container with readiness, restarts, state and last exit: pick one
 and l/p read that container. Search and level stay active across panes.
 w writes the filtered pane to /home/demo/kdash_reports/inspector/ (review it before sharing).

